    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Waifu Builder</strong>- a relaxing puzzle game inspired by Model building(gunpla) but with just 100% waifus. You will experience the relaxing process of building a model kit with complete freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut out, assemble, paint and customize your waifus in 9 different themes such as: gothic, maids, bikini, medieval fantasy, demons and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building all the waifu kits will take around 6-8 hours of your time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >61 waifu kits to build </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 waifu themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total freedom to assemble the models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize them as you like</p></li></ul>",
